			"notes": "EMUtils now ships one jar per Minecraft version. This release supports **26.2** and **26.3**; 26.1.x is no longer supported.\n\n## Added\n\n- Minecraft 26.3 support.\n- Speed line in the HUD Overlay: shows your speed in blocks per second, including while riding, flying with an elytra or falling. Off by default.\n- No Falling Leaf Particles in Visual Tweaks: hides the leaves drifting down from trees, including cherry, pale oak and the new 26.3 poplar leaves. Off by default.\n- Mod Menu integration: open the EMUtils settings from Mod Menu's config button.\n- `/emutils` command: open settings, toggle features by name, reset a feature to its defaults, and export or import your config through the clipboard.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Light Level Overlay numbers now show with Iris shader packs.\n- Light Level Overlay no longer lags from constantly rescanning chunks.\n- Zoom's Hide Hand option now hides your hand again.\n- The HUD Overlay panel widens to fit long values such as the Old Growth Spruce Taiga biome instead of spilling past its edge.\n\n## Improved\n\n- Ctrl+Backspace deletes whole words in the settings hub search, and Ctrl+Delete deletes the next word in the script editor.\n- EMHelpers is now built into EMUtils, so it's no longer a separate dependency."
		},
