			"notes": "## Added\n\n- Added a No Pumpkin Overlay toggle to hide the carved pumpkin blur while wearing one.\n- Added a regular HUD mode for Free Camera, optionally showing the real player's hand, hotbar, health, armor, food, and XP.\n\n## Improved\n\n- EMUtils now targets the two latest Minecraft 26.x releases (26.1.2 and 26.2). Minecraft 1.21.x and older 26.x releases are no longer maintained.\n- Legit Quick Stack now adds a short, varied delay between stacks instead of transferring instantly.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Fixed copied chat messages retaining legacy section formatting codes."
